/-- The slice of the metric contraction `Σ g_{jl} k^j k^l` (frozen `k`) has derivative
`Σ ∂_b(g_{jl}) k^j k^l` when the metric components are differentiable at `x`. -/
theorem hasDerivAt_contract_slice {g : Metric n} {x : Pt n} (hg : ∀ i j, DifferentiableAt ℝ (g i j) x)
